5. The CO2 sequestration plant process example
   (data/dexpi_process_examples/CO2 sequestration plant - Oslo/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------

CO2TerminalExample.xml and the slides "2026-05-04 CO2 for DEXPI 2 and OPC.pdf" are a DEXPI 2.0
process model of a demonstration CO2 handling and injection system and its graphical
presentation, (c) 2026 David Cameron, University of Oslo, licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.

Source: built by the author for the OPC Materials Subject Group and contributed as is; the
reference, author, date and licence are in that directory's README.md.

Changes: CO2TerminalExample.xml is unchanged. CO2TerminalExample-corrected.xml is an adaptation
generated from it by data/dexpi_process_examples/make_corrected.py; its leading XML comment lists
every change (three misspelt type and reference names) and every deliberate non-change. The PDF
was converted from the original PowerPoint slides.


