Source: https://gitlab.com/dexpi/Specification/-/releases/V2.0.1 (tag V2.0.1, commit
eef0f0c6e8edfe84582e7a45d109c396bdc544f8), the file src/documentation/_static/DEXPI_XML_Schema.xsd.

Changes: none. The committed file is byte-identical to that source (SHA-256
0bd6568b7c52fd59ac4ef6d8547ab2b2aa890c009a3a1bfbc5d7cc18c53b36e6); a Windows checkout may show
